{0E}"And Council Chair Wattner happened to see it...
Until just the other day, I was demoted to the provinces.{0F}
'The short-tempered have no place in the capital,' I was told."{w}{p}"It's the capital, so I do understand that...{w}But what is so wrong with research for the good of the land!?"{w}

"And besides, all that 'egghead, egghead' --
what exactly is wrong with that?"{w}{p}"That word might be a compliment, if anything,
but it could never be an insult.........Excuse me."{w}

{0E}"I have every confidence in my research.
Whenever you want to know the weather, ask me any time.{0F}
Though I will charge the facility fee."{w}

{0E}"Ah... and one more thing: watch out for storms.
Tornadoes only occur in certain places, but{0F}
they can easily blow a person away."{w}{p}"...I do worry about you, a little."{w}

{0E}"Yo! You guys dropped your wallet, right?
Say it again: you dropped it, right!{0F}
RIGHT!?"{w}

{0E}"...............Right, I'll pay ya back real soon!
Wait for me, okay!?{0F}
...............Don't... get your hopes up, though."{w}

{0E}"The ones puttin' on a good, harmless face,
they're the nastiest of the lot. Got it?{0F}
...Do ya really get it, though?"{w}

"Dear adventurers,{w}the other day, I heard from another patron..."{w}{p}"...that in the Giaf Dunes there is a bird
with a truly powerful cry."{w}{p}"They say those birds
eat the flesh of a plant that grows in the desert{w}to keep their voices strong."{w}{p}"That is what I was told."{w}
